        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"krysskroz\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/a88e4f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> krysskroz:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah it is bigger so it can hold sleeved cards.&nbsp; Now that I bought sleeves I need an extra one of those boxes.&nbsp; They were for sale on here for awhile and I was wondering if there are plans to sell just the boxes again?&nbsp;I really hope I didn't miss out because I just dropped a ton of money on sleeves (went with Dragon Shields which are very nice but pricey).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Just checked and I can <em>just_barely</em> fit my sleeved cards into the RC/IR combined box. We'll see how well it works in practice if and when I decide to store them there. My beloved briefcase of Sentinels Holding works great, but will not even handle Vengeance, much less any future expansions.</p>\n<p>Perhaps, though, between the RC/IR box and the Vengeance box I'll be able to hold all of the cards, sleeved. Then I can use, say, the Shattered Timelines box to hold the oversized cards, tokens, and other things.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:09:21.421Z",
