        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"krysskroz\"]\n\nYeah it is bigger so it can hold sleeved cards.&nbsp; Now that I bought sleeves I need an extra one of those boxes.&nbsp; They were for sale on here for awhile and I was wondering if there are plans to sell just the boxes again?&nbsp;I really hope I didn&#39;t miss out because I just dropped a ton of money on sleeves (went with Dragon Shields which are very nice but pricey).\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nJust checked and I can _just_barely_ fit my sleeved cards into the RC/IR combined box. We&#39;ll see how well it works in practice if and when I decide to store them there. My beloved briefcase of Sentinels Holding works great, but will not even handle Vengeance, much less any future expansions.\n\nPerhaps, though, between the RC/IR box and the Vengeance box I&#39;ll be able to hold all of the cards, sleeved. Then I can use, say, the Shattered Timelines box to hold the oversized cards, tokens, and other things.\n",
